s. It maintains the possibility of forming All Terminals and Honors by eliminating a middle Dot tile while retaining terminal tiles (T1, T9, B1) and honor tiles (J1, J3). The pair of W7s also remains intact for potential pung/kong development.\nAnswer: Play B7"}
